Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.30,0:22:44.34,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fscy100.06\fscx100.06\c&H2C2D2D&\pos(425.97,874.16)\frz9.98}我倆一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.34,0:22:44.38,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fscy100.04\fscx100.04\c&H2C2D2D&\pos(426.06,874.02)\frz9.98}我倆一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.38,0:22:44.43,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fscy100.02\fscx100.02\c&H2C2D2D&\pos(426.13,873.9)\frz9.98}我倆一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.43,0:22:44.51,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fscy100\fscx100\c&H2C2D2D&\pos(426.2,873.8)\frz9.98}我倆一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.44,0:00:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,司令部 司令部
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.86,0:00:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,斷了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.99,0:00:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.57,0:00:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,誰知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.41,0:00:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,快點出來 不然開槍了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.16,0:00:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,想殺了繪里香嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈 開店了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.51,0:00:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好 這就來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.99,0:02:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 都搞成這樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.70,0:02:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.57,0:02:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,上次的照片 這個
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.79,0:02:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,給你傳的那個
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.37,0:02:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 這個啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.83,0:02:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我讓DA情報部解析了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.83,0:02:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,就算看不清臉但從體格大體上也能鎖定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.05,0:02:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,什
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.68,0:02:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是說DA解不到這種畫質吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.43,0:02:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞希 我們說不定能趕超DA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.97,0:02:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了 瑞希
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.48,0:02:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.35,0:02:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼急了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.90,0:02:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 時間到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.15,0:02:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,胡桃 時間到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.48,0:02:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,比劃比劃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.28,0:02:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 閉店桌遊會盛大開幕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.87,0:03:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你不說明天就截稿了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.29,0:03:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,和今天的我沒有關係
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.91,0:03:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,別說工作的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.21,0:03:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,其實我也在執行任務中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.63,0:03:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣不好吧 警官
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.84,0:03:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,快開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.67,0:03:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那來看誰先手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.63,0:03:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈也一起玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.80,0:03:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我會幫你核帳的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.14,0:03:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,已經完事了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.43,0:03:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好快
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.35,0:03:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,收銀無差錯 無錯帳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.35,0:03:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是說沒工作了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.15,0:03:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈來玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.27,0:03:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,來來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.02,0:03:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,玩玩如何 瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.36,0:03:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不必了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.49,0:03:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,因為大叔太多了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.45,0:03:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,害羞吧 正是這個年齡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,在店裡玩確實奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.53,0:03:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不一起玩玩嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.41,0:03:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣做能回DA嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.59,0:03:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.84,0:03:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,一起玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.22,0:03:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.43,0:03:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我正要回家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.89,0:04:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,明天呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,明天休業
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.35,0:04:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我要換衣服了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.22,0:04:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,所以明天也聚聚一起玩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.77,0:04:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,千束
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.52,0:04:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,體檢體測都做完了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.11,0:04:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那個 還沒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.36,0:04:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,還要去深山老林裡好累啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.69,0:04:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,明天就最後一天了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.74,0:04:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,趕緊去更新證件
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.99,0:04:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你要還想繼續工作就快去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,老師去通融下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.71,0:04:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,楠木肯定會給老師面子的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.04,0:04:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,去見司令嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.34,0:04:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,穿好衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.97,0:04:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,請帶我一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.34,0:04:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好快
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.22,0:04:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.47,0:04:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.48,0:04:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了 瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.61,0:05:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,想和楠木說什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.57,0:05:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,正在構思
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.08,0:05:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈 吃糖嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.12,0:05:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不必了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.41,0:05:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你還得體檢呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.71,0:05:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,就一個
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.38,0:05:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,攝取糖分會對血糖 血脂 肝功等測定值有影響
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.18,0:05:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.18,0:05:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,恭候光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.19,0:05:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,錦木女士 井上女士
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.07,0:05:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,開門
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.22,0:06:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,給
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.64,0:06:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,錦木女士請前往隔壁醫療棟進行體檢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.39,0:06:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,井上女士…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.52,0:06:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我想見楠木司令
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.68,0:06:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,司令正在開會
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.81,0:06:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,兩小時後才回來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.11,0:06:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.02,0:06:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,看 是謀害同伴的那個
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.11,0:06:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,被DA開除了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.53,0:06:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,據說和她組隊的都進醫院了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.82,0:06:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.53,0:06:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,她們怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.66,0:06:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,要等嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.49,0:06:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,據說無視命令
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,她怎麼敢的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.96,0:06:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我去趟訓練場
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.04,0:06:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,等等瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.25,0:06:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,等等瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.38,0:06:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.81,0:06:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,千束
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.69,0:07:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,最可靠的蜂斗居然最後一天才更新證件
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.19,0:07:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.44,0:07:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,忙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.07,0:07:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不要和你相提並論
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.33,0:07:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,老師還好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.87,0:07:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,很好啊 抽空也來玩玩呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.75,0:07:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,都說了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.58,0:07:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,對對 你要說除任務之外不得隨意外出吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.71,0:07:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是抱怨
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你都見不到想見的人了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 好煩 不說了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.55,0:07:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,和瀧奈相處得怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.55,0:07:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我當然沒打她
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.93,0:07:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你好煩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.32,0:07:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼帶她來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.07,0:07:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定是她想回歸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.99,0:07:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.29,0:07:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼非得來這
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是你想法異常
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.87,0:08:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我們這些孤兒被DA拯救在這裡撫養
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,對父母沒有感激之情嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.30,0:08:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,當然有 但是也有自立情結之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.97,0:08:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,還帶著老師算自立嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.97,0:08:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,對調動組來說總店又是特別的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.51,0:08:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,既然你都知道怎麼不來幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.85,0:08:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那是上層決定的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.35,0:08:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,別找藉口了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你還真不遜當年呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.50,0:08:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不見 千束
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.62,0:08:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.21,0:08:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你都不給Lycoris出力 還想要持證特權
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.17,0:08:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我偶爾也做些DA的工作啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.18,0:08:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,千束 尊重長官
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.34,0:08:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.64,0:08:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼把她開除了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.43,0:08:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,違反命令
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.89,0:08:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.73,0:08:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但她救了同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,結果是千支槍的下落依然不明
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.02,0:09:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不該殺掉證人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.40,0:09:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,這你看了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.19,0:09:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,這是司令部誤判交易時間的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.53,0:09:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,楠木也有責任吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.07,0:09:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 千束
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.41,0:09:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你關心他人前先幹好本職工作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.46,0:09:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,發證可不是給你玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.21,0:09:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,想糊弄過去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.59,0:09:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,別說了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.29,0:09:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,再說
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,猶豫不決的前線指揮也有責任吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.05,0:09:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,有什麼辦法 通信故障和司令部
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.97,0:09:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,蜂斗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,通信故障
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.52,0:09:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,用Radiata監視著還有通信故障肯定不尋常吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.73,0:09:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,只是技術問題
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.69,0:09:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 楠木
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.07,0:09:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Radiata被黑了問題就大了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.82,0:09:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道你在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.70,0:09:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,楠木
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.53,0:09:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,住口吧 千束
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.99,0:09:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不服從命令的Lycoris是沒用的 僅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.16,0:10:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,蜂斗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.75,0:10:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,把瀧奈調回DA啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.04,0:10:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,替補都到位了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.43,0:10:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,挺厲害嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.72,0:10:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 我是乙女櫻
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.58,0:10:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,無視命令掃射同伴是真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,看來是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.17,0:10:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 我只是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.09,0:10:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,比起敵人還是痛擊隊友更燃嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,住口
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.22,0:10:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.84,0:10:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,可別開槍啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.01,0:11:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,聽說你只有殺人的時候會笑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.35,0:11:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是誰胡扯的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.02,0:11:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不過我挺佩服的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.77,0:11:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,就像電影裡的殺人狂一樣好帥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.73,0:11:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不過請放心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.32,0:11:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,前輩的爛攤子我來接任拾掇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.24,0:11:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,接任
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.57,0:11:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你沒聽說嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.07,0:11:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,接下來我會加入蜂斗小隊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.45,0:11:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,已經沒你的位置了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.70,0:11:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.37,0:11:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,閉嘴 小子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.62,0:11:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你哪位
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.75,0:11:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,她是千束
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.29,0:11:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,蜂斗前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.75,0:11:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,司令也在
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.38,0:11:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,這個就是電視塔的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.38,0:11:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,別說這個
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.01,0:11:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,只是笨蛋而已
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.84,0:11:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,司令
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.68,0:11:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那張照片是我提交的槍枝交易新情報
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.02,0:11:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,這成果能讓我回歸DA嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.81,0:11:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,回歸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.90,0:11:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,取得成果我就能
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.61,0:11:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不記得說過
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.65,0:11:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,楠木
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.32,0:11:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.53,0:11:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,沒聽出來是讓你放棄嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.57,0:12:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,可怕 不愧是電視塔的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.45,0:12:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,跟傳說中的一樣兇猛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.99,0:12:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,櫻 該訓練了 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.25,0:12:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜 我還想多聊聊的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.92,0:12:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.21,0:12:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你還不明白我那拳什麼意思嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.55,0:12:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就直說了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,DA已經不需要你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.34,0:12:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,閉嘴 蜂斗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.93,0:12:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,還不懂嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.68,0:12:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那現在就來模擬戰挨虐清醒下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.02,0:12:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 瀧奈上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.81,0:12:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,鬆手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.69,0:12:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.61,0:12:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,怕了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好 二對二
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.53,0:12:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.41,0:12:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,嚇跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.37,0:12:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你也跑嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:12:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,就知道你來這
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.72,0:13:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Lycoris人人都喜歡這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.35,0:13:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,住在這裡是被DA撫養孩子的憧憬
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.14,0:13:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,穿上制服的那一刻…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.06,0:13:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,很高興吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.36,0:13:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,也不至於感到意外吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我也一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.82,0:13:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那你應該明白吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.32,0:13:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡是目標
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.25,0:13:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,而我卻被剝奪了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.75,0:13:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.88,0:13:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,街道上需要你幫助的人還很多
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,就算不在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.47,0:13:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,因為DA需要你才肆無忌憚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.43,0:13:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,而我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.06,0:13:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我的容身處
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.23,0:13:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,已經不在這了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.03,0:13:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.74,0:14:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.61,0:14:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 是我不對
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.12,0:14:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那時瀧奈想救出同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.16,0:14:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是命令
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.95,0:14:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是自己決定的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.54,0:14:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.63,0:14:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈的遭遇與此無關
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.21,0:14:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那天通信故障是真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.17,0:14:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,對 只有幾分鐘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.09,0:14:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,說是技術問題
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.64,0:14:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是駭客
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.10,0:14:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Radiata被黑了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.26,0:14:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那可是的肩負DA機密性的最強AI
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,擁有最高優先度卻發生通信故障是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.23,0:14:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,駭客 所以交易時間呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.11,0:14:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但這種事情可不能上報
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.11,0:14:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,所以就以Lycoris的獨斷行為把瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.74,0:14:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,去哪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.28,0:14:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,這太荒唐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.33,0:14:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我去和司令
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.16,0:14:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.37,0:14:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,最後只會是死不認帳
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.75,0:15:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈 現在該向前看了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.26,0:15:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,禍兮福所倚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.26,0:15:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,如果瀧奈當時沒那麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.59,0:15:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我們就見不到了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.56,0:15:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.02,0:15:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,她們抱了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.35,0:15:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,太青春了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.81,0:15:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,真有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.98,0:15:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,能與你相識太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.27,0:15:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.07,0:15:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.07,0:15:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,因他人的期待而自怨自艾太無聊了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.37,0:15:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,有你的容身處
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.91,0:15:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,體驗一下與店裡的大家共度歡樂時光吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.66,0:15:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,相比之下還是這裡好的話再回來也不晚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.62,0:15:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,還不晚 以後路長著呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.09,0:15:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,機會會有的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.25,0:15:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那時再選擇自己想做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.97,0:15:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,想做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.22,0:15:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.80,0:15:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我的原則就是優先做想做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.31,0:15:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不過 造成的失敗也挺多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.68,0:15:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,現在想做的是給那些臭臉的傢伙點顏色瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.27,0:15:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我去去就回
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.73,0:16:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,時間1400開始實戰演習 Lycoris請到戰鬥室集合
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.95,0:16:18.33,Top,,0,0,0,,重複 時間1400開始實戰演習 Lycoris請到戰鬥室集合
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.12,0:16:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,繪里香 瀧奈來了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.83,0:16:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.13,0:16:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.34,0:16:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,之後她要和蜂斗模擬戰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.09,0:16:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,蜂斗會為你復仇的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.22,0:16:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.09,0:16:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有仇
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.76,0:16:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,她都向你掃射了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.55,0:16:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我不活著嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.31,0:16:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,被敵人抓住的人是我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.98,0:16:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.19,0:16:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但殺了證人可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.86,0:16:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.27,0:16:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,雖說如此
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.82,0:16:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼 電視塔英雄要模擬戰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.86,0:16:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,真假 能看到千束嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.99,0:16:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快點快點
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.15,0:16:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,火花你不去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.11,0:16:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,曾經的搭檔對決
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.12,0:16:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.41,0:16:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,還可能關係到瀧奈回歸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.88,0:17:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 全員就你嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.67,0:17:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有人沒來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,這是策略
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.13,0:17:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,這是保存王牌的體力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,除任務外她是不會戰鬥的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.72,0:17:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,看人真沒眼光
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.60,0:17:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,就這還能當頭牌呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.43,0:17:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你才是那制服是裝飾嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.19,0:17:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,只敢射橡膠的膽小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.06,0:17:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼東西 你哪個學校的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.28,0:17:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,腦袋裡全是橡膠嗎 你這輩子就在電視塔下沏茶吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.49,0:17:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.45,0:17:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你們關係真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.91,0:17:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,準備好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,請便請便
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,雙方注意 要當作實戰對決
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.46,0:17:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,各就位
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.84,0:17:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,開始
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.27,0:18:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,還行嘛 蜂斗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.94,0:18:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,正如預料
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.20,0:18:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,來了來了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.04,0:18:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,槍法不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.79,0:18:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,別囂張
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.12,0:18:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,這麼近舉槍可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.29,0:18:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,已經死兩次了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.67,0:18:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,她何方神聖
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.97,0:18:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼猖獗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.01,0:18:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,她在等呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.47,0:18:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,她人就這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.31,0:18:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈 現在該向前看了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.35,0:18:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,禍兮福所倚
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.81,0:18:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,因他人的期待而自怨自艾太無聊了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.28,0:18:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,有你的容身處
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.70,0:18:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,體驗一下與店裡的大家共度歡樂時光吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.57,0:18:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,相比之下還是這裡好的話再回來也不晚
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.53,0:19:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,還不晚 以後路長著呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.54,0:19:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,機會會有的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.83,0:19:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,亂打是打不中的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.92,0:19:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我對射擊有信心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.92,0:19:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,所以就更打不中了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.42,0:19:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,東西掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.13,0:19:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.22,0:19:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,別去 櫻
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.54,0:19:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.72,0:20:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.77,0:20:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是千束嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.85,0:20:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,頭回拜見身手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.73,0:20:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼奇術
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.02,0:20:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,洞察力能看穿槍擊軌跡和時機的天才
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.62,0:20:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,以這個距離想擊中千束也難
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.33,0:20:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但除此以外
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.04,0:20:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,就是個囂張小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.59,0:20:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈 來車接我們回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.17,0:20:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,這就去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.68,0:20:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道這是模擬戰嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.18,0:20:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,放冷槍就省事了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.51,0:20:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,還衝上來肉搏你瘋了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.89,0:20:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣就扯平了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.73,0:20:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你果然還是沒用的Lycoris
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.94,0:20:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,違反命令 獨斷專行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.49,0:21:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,別再回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.95,0:21:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我先走了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.66,0:21:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,開玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.24,0:21:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.00,0:21:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我槍法菜還連累了前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.13,0:21:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你射擊準確反而更容易躲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.63,0:21:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,她能躲開子彈嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.55,0:21:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那不跟漫畫一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.72,0:21:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,就是這點很火大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.93,0:21:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,下次絕對要贏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.35,0:21:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,等等我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.44,0:21:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.81,0:21:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,沒關係嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.81,0:21:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,贏了就回歸不是假的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.86,0:21:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道要說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.61,0:21:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.53,0:21:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,說笑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.92,0:21:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.13,0:21:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.80,0:21:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你瞄準我開的槍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.55,0:22:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你能躲開
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.60,0:22:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是個反常識的人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.89,0:22:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但是感覺很爽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.11,0:22:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.20,0:22:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.00,0:22:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.41,0:22:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,到手了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.58,0:22:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,千束也來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.51,0:22:47.43,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,360)\blur7.5}君が持ってきた漫画
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.43,0:22:50.43,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}くれた知らない名前のお花
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.72,0:22:53.06,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}今日はまだ来ないかな?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.18,0:22:56.44,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}初めての感情知ってしまった
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.90,0:23:02.36,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}窓に飾った絵画をなぞってひとりで宇宙を旅して
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.49,0:23:07.70,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}それだけでいいはずだったのに
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.70,0:23:14.04,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}君の手を握ってしまったら
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.37,0:23:20.25,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}孤独を知らないこの街には
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.25,0:23:31.01,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}もう二度と帰ってくることはできないのでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.31,0:23:42.40,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}君が手を差し伸べた　光で影が生まれる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.53,0:23:48.24,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}歌って聞かせてこの話の続き
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.24,0:23:57.25,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}連れて行って見たことない星まで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.51,0:22:47.43,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,360)\blur7.5}你送我的漫畫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.43,0:22:50.43,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}和不知名的花
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.72,0:22:53.06,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}今天還沒來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.18,0:22:56.44,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}這種感情初次體驗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.90,0:23:02.36,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}在窗上臨摹塗鴉  獨自前往星辰大海
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.49,0:23:07.70,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}我本該心滿意足
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.70,0:23:14.04,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}直到握住你的手
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.37,0:23:20.25,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}在這不懂孤獨的街道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.25,0:23:31.01,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}已經再也回不到從前了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.31,0:23:42.40,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}你伸出了手  光影伴生
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.53,0:23:48.24,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}聽我歌唱 聽我訴說
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.24,0:23:57.25,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}帶我去未知的星球
